==History==
2020
*The Firecracker was made available before its general release on 6/1/2020 via the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]]. She was also available in a [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenge]] as a reward {{Balance|Add}}.
*The Firecracker [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 3/2/2020 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 4/2/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2020)|Balance Update]], added the Firecracker to [[Clan Wars]] [[Clan Wars/Clan Wars I|Collection Day]] card pool, Draft selections, and Mega Deck [[Touchdown]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], added the Firecracker as a Trophy Road reward {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 7/7/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/7/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Firecracker's recoil range to 1.5 tiles (from 2 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Firecracker from Hog Mountain to Serenity Peak {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Firecracker from Serenity Peak to Spooky Town {{Balance|Buff}}. It also added the Efficient Attacker [[Card Mastery]] task for the Firecracker {{Balance|Add}}.
2023 
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Firecracker’s first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Firecracker’s first attack time interval to 0.55 seconds (from 0.6 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}, increased the Firecracker’s first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.55 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and added the Firecracker's Evolution {{Balance|Add}}. It also changed the Firecracker's card image and card render {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 30/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(30/6/2023)|maintenance break]], increased the Firecracker’s first attack time interval to 0.65 seconds (from 0.6 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2025
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that damage boost from the [[Rune Giant]] would be split on Firecracker instead of being granted to each of her projectiles {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] decreased the Firecrackes's sight range to 8 tiles (from 8.5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}} and decreased her recoil range to 1 tile (from 1.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 6/4/2026, a Balance Update, increased her projectile speed to 500 (from 400){{Balance|Buff}}.

